     <target value="A program for improving the quality, transparency and efficiency of administrative public services at national and sub-nationallevels developed.
New service delivery model piloted in three rayons."></target>
     <actual value="Review of administrative services provided at the central  level completed.   568 services catalogued,  
recommendations onreorganizing, merging, and discontinuing services developed.
The development of the program for improving the quality, transparencyand efficiency of administrative public services at national and sub-national levels is ongoing.
New service delivery model isbeing piloted in three ministries.">
